#: ../../source/advance.rst:3
msgid "Advanced Usage"
msgstr "高级用法"

#: ../../source/advance.rst:6
msgid "MPS Simulator"
msgstr "MPS 模拟器"

#: ../../source/advance.rst:8
msgid ""
"TensorCircuit-NG provides Matrix Product State (MPS) simulation as an "
"efficient alternative to exact simulation for quantum circuits. MPS "
"simulation can handle larger quantum systems by trading off accuracy for "
"computational efficiency."
msgstr ""
"TensorCircuit-NG 提供了矩阵乘积态 (MPS) 模拟，作为量子线路精确模拟的高效替代方案。MPS "
"模拟可以通过权衡精度与计算效率来处理更大规模的量子系统。"

#: ../../source/advance.rst:10
msgid ""
"MPS simulator is very straightforward to use, we provide the same set of "
"API for ``MPSCircuit`` as ``Circuit``, the only new line is to set the "
"bond dimension for the new simulator."
msgstr ""
"MPS 模拟器的使用非常直观。我们为 ``MPSCircuit`` 提供了与 ``Circuit`` 相同的一套 "
"API，唯一的区别是需要为新的模拟器设置截断维度 (bond dimension)。"

#: ../../source/advance.rst:18
msgid ""
"The larger bond dimension we set, the better approximation ratio (of "
"course the more computational cost we pay)."
msgstr "设置的截断维度越大，近似比例就越好（当然，计算成本也会相应增加）。"

#: ../../source/advance.rst:22
msgid "Stacked gates syntax"
msgstr "堆叠门语法"

#: ../../source/advance.rst:24
msgid ""
"Stacked-gate is a simple syntactic sugar rendering circuit construction "
"easily when multiple gate of the same type are applied on different "
"qubits, namely, the index for gate call can accept list of ints instead "
"of one integer."
msgstr ""
"堆叠门 (Stacked-gate) "
"是一种简单的语法糖，当需要在不同量子比特上应用多个同类型量子门时，它可以简化线路构建。即量子门调用的索引可以接受整数列表，而不仅仅是一个整数。"

#: ../../source/advance.rst:71
msgid "Split Two-qubit Gates"
msgstr "分解双量子比特门"

#: ../../source/advance.rst:73
msgid ""
"The two-qubit gates applied on the circuit can be decomposed via SVD, "
"which may further improve the optimality of the contraction pathfinding."
msgstr "应用在电路上的双量子比特门可以通过 SVD 进行分解，这可以进一步提高收缩路径查找的最优性。"

#: ../../source/advance.rst:75
msgid "``split`` configuration can be set at circuit-level or gate-level."
msgstr "``split`` 配置可以在电路级或门级设置。"

#: ../../source/advance.rst:96
msgid ""
"Note ``max_singular_values`` must be specified to make the whole "
"procedure static and thus jittable."
msgstr "请注意 ``max_singular_values`` 必须被指定以使整个过程成为静态的，从而支持 JIT 编译。"

#: ../../source/advance.rst:99
msgid "Analog circuit simulation"
msgstr "模拟电路模拟"

#: ../../source/advance.rst:101
msgid ""
"TensorCircuit-NG support digital-analog hybrid simulation (say cases in "
"Rydberg atom arrays), where the analog part is simulated by the neural "
"differential equation solver given the API to specify a time dependent "
"Hamiltonian. The simulation is still differentiable and jittable. Only "
"jax backend is supported for analog simulation as the neural ode engine "
"is built on top of jax."
msgstr ""
"TensorCircuit-NG 支持数模混合模拟（例如里德堡原子阵列中的情况），其中模拟部分由神经常微分方程 (ODE) "
"求解器模拟，并提供指定随时间变化的哈密顿量的 API。模拟过程仍然是可微且可 JIT 编译的。由于神经网络 ODE 引擎是构建在 JAX "
"之上的，因此模拟模拟目前仅支持 JAX 后端。"

#: ../../source/advance.rst:104
msgid ""
"This utility is super helpful for optimizing quantum control or "
"investigating digital-analog hybrid variational quantum schemes."
msgstr "该工具对于优化量子控制或研究数模混合变分量子方案非常有用。"

#: ../../source/advance.rst:106
msgid ""
"We support two modes of analog simulation, where "
":py:func:`tensorcircuit.experimental.evol_global` evolve the state via a "
"Hamiltonian define on the whole system, and "
":py:func:`tensorcircuit.experimental.evol_local` evolve the state via a "
"Hamiltonian define on a local subsystem."
msgstr ""
"我们支持两种模拟模式：:py:func:`tensorcircuit.experimental.evol_global` "
"通过定义在整个系统上的哈密顿量演化状态，而 :py:func:`tensorcircuit.experimental.evol_local` "
"通过定义在局部子系统上的哈密顿量演化状态。"

#: ../../source/advance.rst:110
msgid ""
"``evol_global`` uses sparse Hamiltonian while ``evol_local`` uses dense "
"Hamiltonian."
msgstr "``evol_global`` 使用稀疏哈密顿量，而 ``evol_local`` 使用稠密哈密顿量。"

#: ../../source/advance.rst:153
msgid "Time Evolution"
msgstr "时间演化"

#: ../../source/advance.rst:155
msgid ""
"TensorCircuit-NG provides several methods for simulating quantum time "
"evolution, including exact diagonalization, Krylov subspace methods, and "
"ODE-based approaches. These methods are essential for studying quantum "
"dynamics, particularly in many-body systems, and all support automatic "
"differentiation (AD) and JIT compilation for enhanced performance."
msgstr ""
"TensorCircuit-NG 提供了多种模拟量子时间演化的方法，包括精确对角化、Krylov 子空间方法和基于 ODE "
"的方法。这些方法对于研究量子动力学（特别是多体系统）至关重要，并且都支持自动微分 (AD) 和 JIT 编译以提高性能。"

#: ../../source/advance.rst:157
msgid "**Exact Diagonalization:**"
msgstr "**精确对角化 (ED):**"

#: ../../source/advance.rst:159
msgid ""
"For small systems where full diagonalization is feasible, the "
":py:func:`tensorcircuit.timeevol.ed_evol` method provides exact time "
"evolution by directly computing matrix exponentials (alias "
":py:func:`tensorcircuit.timeevol.hamiltonian_evol`):"
msgstr ""
"对于可以进行完全对角化的小系统，:py:func:`tensorcircuit.timeevol.ed_evol` "
"方法通过直接计算矩阵指数提供精确的时间演化（别名 "
":py:func:`tensorcircuit.timeevol.hamiltonian_evol`）："

#: ../../source/advance.rst:194
msgid ""
"This method is particularly efficient for time-independent Hamiltonians "
"as it uses eigendecomposition to compute the evolution. It provides exact"
" results but is limited to small systems (typically <16 qubits) due to "
"the exponential growth of the Hilbert space."
msgstr ""
"该方法对于与时间无关的哈密顿量特别有效，因为它使用特征值分解来计算演化。它提供精确的结果，但由于希尔伯特空间的指数增长，仅限于小系统（通常 <16"
" 个量子比特）。"

#: ../../source/advance.rst:198
msgid ""
"Unlike the other evolution methods in this section, ``ed_evol`` evaluates"
" ``exp(-t * H)`` and normalizes each output state. Real-valued times "
"therefore produce imaginary-time evolution. For real-time evolution, use "
"``times = 1.j * tc.backend.convert_to_tensor([0.0, 0.5, 1.0, 2.0])``."
msgstr ""
"与本节的其它演化方法不同，``ed_evol`` 计算 ``exp(-t * H)`` "
"并对每个输出态做归一化。因此实数时间会产生虚时演化。若要进行实时演化，请使用 ``times = 1.j * "
"tc.backend.convert_to_tensor([0.0, 0.5, 1.0, 2.0])``。"

#: ../../source/advance.rst:204
msgid "**Krylov Subspace Methods:**"
msgstr "**Krylov 子空间方法:**"

#: ../../source/advance.rst:206
msgid ""
"For larger systems where exact diagonalization becomes intractable, the "
"Krylov subspace method provides an efficient approximation. The "
":py:func:`tensorcircuit.timeevol.krylov_evol` function implements this "
"approach:"
msgstr ""
"对于精确对角化难以处理的大系统，Krylov "
"子空间方法提供了一种高效的近似。:py:func:`tensorcircuit.timeevol.krylov_evol` 函数实现了该方法："

#: ../../source/advance.rst:242
msgid ""
"The Krylov method constructs a small subspace that captures the essential"
" dynamics, making it possible to simulate larger systems efficiently. It "
"uses Hermitian Lanczos iteration and therefore requires a Hermitian "
"Hamiltonian. The deprecated ``scan_impl`` argument is accepted for "
"compatibility but no longer changes the calculation."
msgstr ""
"Krylov 方法构造一个捕捉本质动力学的小子空间，从而能够高效地模拟更大的系统。它使用 Hermitian Lanczos "
"迭代，因此要求哈密顿量是 Hermitian 的。已弃用的 ``scan_impl`` 参数仅为兼容性而接受，但不再改变计算。"

#: ../../source/advance.rst:248
msgid "**Chebyshev Expansion:**"
msgstr "**Chebyshev 展开：**"

#: ../../source/advance.rst:250
msgid ""
"For time-independent Hermitian Hamiltonians with a reliable spectral "
"interval, the fixed-order Chebyshev expansion is a useful JIT-friendly "
"alternative. It expands ``exp(-1j * t * H)`` in Chebyshev polynomials of "
"the rescaled Hamiltonian, so it uses only repeated Hamiltonian-vector "
"products and can be more economical than a fully reorthogonalized Krylov "
"basis. The expansion order depends on ``t`` and the spectral width, so "
"its parameters must be chosen outside the compiled evolution kernel while"
" the kernel itself stays JIT- and AD-friendly. The "
":py:func:`tensorcircuit.timeevol.chebyshev_evol` function implements this"
" approach:"
msgstr ""
"对于具有可靠谱区间的含时无关 Hermitian 哈密顿量，固定阶数的 Chebyshev 展开是一个有用的、对 JIT 友好的替代方案。它把 "
"``exp(-1j * t * H)`` 在重标定后哈密顿量的 Chebyshev "
"多项式中展开，因此只需重复进行哈密顿量-向量乘法，可能比完全重正交化的 Krylov 基更经济。展开阶数取决于 ``t`` "
"和谱宽，因此其参数必须在编译后的演化内核之外选取，而内核本身仍保持对 JIT 和 AD "
"友好。:py:func:`tensorcircuit.timeevol.chebyshev_evol` 函数实现了该方法："

#: ../../source/advance.rst:283
msgid ""
"The Hamiltonian may be a dense/sparse matrix, a ``LinearOperator``, or a "
"matrix-free MVP callable such as "
":py:func:`tensorcircuit.quantum.PauliStringSum2MVP`. Because ``k`` is a "
"fixed Python integer, the evolution has a fixed computation schedule and "
"is compatible with JIT compilation, ``vmap`` over evolution times, and "
"reverse-mode autodiff:"
msgstr ""
"哈密顿量可以是稠密/稀疏矩阵、``LinearOperator``，或像 "
":py:func:`tensorcircuit.quantum.PauliStringSum2MVP` 这样无矩阵的 MVP 可调用对象。由于 "
"``k`` 是固定的 Python 整数，演化具有固定的计算调度，并且兼容 JIT 编译、对演化时间做 ``vmap`` 以及反向模式自动微分："

#: ../../source/advance.rst:293
msgid ""
"Chebyshev exponential routines, including ``chebyshev_evol`` and "
"Chebyshev-based time-correlation and thermal calculations, support the "
"NumPy and JAX backends. On TensorFlow, use Krylov or Taylor methods for "
"exponential actions. SLQ, KPM DOS, resolvent, and FFT calculations are "
"also available on TensorFlow."
msgstr ""
"Chebyshev 指数相关例程（包括 ``chebyshev_evol`` 以及基于 Chebyshev 的时间关联和热计算）支持 NumPy "
"和 JAX 后端。在 TensorFlow 上，请使用 Krylov 或 Taylor 方法进行指数作用。SLQ、KPM "
"DOS、resolvent 和 FFT 计算在 TensorFlow 上也可用。"

#: ../../source/advance.rst:295
msgid ""
"See ``examples/xxz_spectral_physics.py`` for a complete KPM, SLQ, and "
"Krylov calculation of DOS, spectral, thermal-energy, and heat-capacity "
"observables."
msgstr ""
"完整示例见 ``examples/xxz_spectral_physics.py``，其中用 KPM、SLQ 和 Krylov 计算 "
"DOS、谱、热能和热容等观测量。"

#: ../../source/advance.rst:297
msgid ""
"Generate trace probes before compiling the estimator with "
"``tc.spectral.random_trace_probes(num_probes=256, dimension=dimension)`` "
"and pass the resulting tensor as ``probes``. To generate probes inside "
"JIT, pass a uniform tensor in ``[0, 1)`` through the ``status`` argument."
" The estimator itself takes explicit probes and performs no random draws."
msgstr ""
"在用 ``tc.spectral.random_trace_probes(num_probes=256, "
"dimension=dimension)`` 编译估计器之前先生成迹探针，并将得到的张量作为 ``probes`` 传入。若要在 JIT "
"内部生成探针，请通过 ``status`` 参数传入一个 ``[0, 1)`` 区间的均匀张量。估计器本身接收显式探针，不做随机采样。"

#: ../../source/advance.rst:299
msgid "**Matrix-function configuration and diagnostics:**"
msgstr "**矩阵函数配置与诊断：**"

#: ../../source/advance.rst:301
msgid ""
"``KrylovConfig(max_dim=...)`` sets the Lanczos width, "
"``ChebyshevConfig(order=..., bounds=(emin, emax))`` sets the polynomial "
"order and spectral interval, and ``TaylorConfig`` sets the Taylor degree "
"and scaling count. Pass these objects through the ``method=`` argument of"
" spectral functions. Matrix-function APIs use bounds in ``(emin, emax)`` "
"order; ``timeevol.chebyshev_evol`` uses ``(emax, emin)``."
msgstr ""
"``KrylovConfig(max_dim=...)`` 设置 Lanczos 宽度，``ChebyshevConfig(order=..., "
"bounds=(emin, emax))`` 设置多项式阶数和谱区间，``TaylorConfig`` 设置 Taylor "
"阶数和缩放次数。通过谱函数的 ``method=`` 参数传入这些对象。矩阵函数 API 的 bounds 顺序为 ``(emin, "
"emax)``；``timeevol.chebyshev_evol`` 使用 ``(emax, emin)``。"

#: ../../source/advance.rst:303
msgid ""
"False entries in a Lanczos or SLQ ``active`` mask are padding after early"
" convergence and are excluded automatically. Exact early breakdown is not"
" differentiable when a perturbation changes the active subspace. "
"``with_std=True`` reports probe sampling uncertainty, not Krylov or "
"Chebyshev truncation error; check truncation by increasing ``max_dim`` or"
" ``order``."
msgstr ""
"Lanczos 或 SLQ 的 ``active`` 掩码中，``False`` "
"项是提前收敛后的填充，会被自动排除。当扰动改变活动子空间时，精确的提前 breakdown 不可微。``with_std=True`` "
"报告的是探针采样不确定度，而不是 Krylov 或 Chebyshev 截断误差；请通过增大 ``max_dim`` 或 ``order`` "
"来检查截断误差。"

#: ../../source/advance.rst:305
msgid ""
"Large ``beta`` and loose spectral bounds can make a one-step Chebyshev "
"imaginary-time calculation inaccurate even when ``order`` is increased. "
"For half evolution with ``energy_shift`` near ``E_min``, use ``0.5 * beta"
" * (E_min - bounds[0]) / scaling_steps <= 15`` as a complex128 starting "
"heuristic; complex64 generally requires a smaller value. Tighten the "
"bounds or increase ``scaling_steps``, whose cost is proportional to "
"``order * scaling_steps``, and verify convergence. Use Krylov/SLQ if the "
"result underflows or the segmented calculation is too expensive."
msgstr ""
"即使增大 ``order``，较大的 ``beta`` 和宽松的谱边界也可能使单步 Chebyshev 虚时计算不准确。对于 "
"``energy_shift`` 接近 ``E_min`` 的半程演化，可将 ``0.5 * beta * (E_min - bounds[0])"
" / scaling_steps <= 15`` 作为 complex128 的起始启发式；complex64 通常需要更小的值。收紧边界或增大 "
"``scaling_steps``（其代价与 ``order * scaling_steps`` "
"成正比），并验证收敛性。如果结果下溢或分段计算过于昂贵，请使用 Krylov/SLQ。"

#: ../../source/advance.rst:307
msgid "**Fixed-Schedule Taylor Exponential Action:**"
msgstr "**固定调度的 Taylor 指数作用：**"

#: ../../source/advance.rst:309
msgid ""
"For a time-independent Hamiltonian represented by a sparse matrix or a "
"matrix-free MVP, :py:func:`tensorcircuit.timeevol.expm_multiply_evol` "
"applies ``exp(-1j * t * H) @ psi`` with a fixed Taylor degree and scaling"
" count. Choose both outside JIT from the maximum evolution time and a "
"1-norm upper bound; the resulting calculation supports JIT compilation "
"and reverse-mode autodiff:"
msgstr ""
"对于由稀疏矩阵或无矩阵 MVP "
"表示的含时无关哈密顿量，:py:func:`tensorcircuit.timeevol.expm_multiply_evol` 以固定的 "
"Taylor 阶数和缩放次数计算 ``exp(-1j * t * H) @ psi``。请在 JIT 之外根据最大演化时间和 "
"1-范数上界选择这两个参数；所得计算支持 JIT 编译和反向模式自动微分："

#: ../../source/advance.rst:326
msgid ""
"When the Hamiltonian trace is known, pass ``traceH`` to remove its scalar"
" part before the Taylor expansion. This only changes a global phase, but "
"can reduce the required work substantially. The repository example "
"``examples/expm_multiply_evol.py`` compares this method with SciPy on "
"CPU."
msgstr ""
"当哈密顿量的迹已知时，传入 ``traceH`` 可在 Taylor "
"展开前去除其标量部分。这只改变一个全局相位，但可以显著减少所需工作量。仓库示例 "
"``examples/expm_multiply_evol.py`` 在 CPU 上将该方法与 SciPy 进行了比较。"

#: ../../source/advance.rst:331
msgid "**ODE-Based Evolution:**"
msgstr "**基于 ODE 的演化:**"

#: ../../source/advance.rst:333
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"For time-dependent Hamiltonians or when fine control over the evolution "
"process is needed, TensorCircuit provides ODE-based evolution methods. "
"These methods solve the time-dependent Schrödinger equation directly by "
"integrating the equation :math:`i\\frac{d}{dt}|\\psi(t)\\rangle = "
"H(t)|\\psi(t)\\rangle`."
msgstr ""
"对于随时间变化的哈密顿量，或者需要对演化过程进行精细控制时，TensorCircuit 提供了基于 ODE 的演化方法。这些方法通过积分方程 "
":math:`i\\frac{d}{dt}|\\psi(t)\\rangle = H(t)|\\psi(t)\\rangle` "
"直接求解随时间变化的薛定谔方程。"

#: ../../source/advance.rst:336
msgid ""
"TensorCircuit provides two ODE-based evolution methods depending on "
"whether the Hamiltonian acts on the entire system or just a local "
"subsystem:"
msgstr "根据哈密顿量是作用于整个系统还是仅作用于局部子系统，TensorCircuit 提供了两种基于 ODE 的演化方法："

#: ../../source/advance.rst:338
msgid ""
"**Global Evolution** (:py:func:`tensorcircuit.timeevol.ode_evol_global`):"
" For time-dependent Hamiltonians acting on the entire system. The "
"Hamiltonian should be provided in sparse matrix format for efficiency."
msgstr ""
"**全局演化** "
"(:py:func:`tensorcircuit.timeevol.ode_evol_global`)：适用于作用于整个系统的含时哈密顿量。为效率起见，哈密顿量应以稀疏矩阵格式提供。"

#: ../../source/advance.rst:421
msgid ""
"**Local Evolution** (:py:func:`tensorcircuit.timeevol.ode_evol_local`): "
"For time-dependent Hamiltonians acting on a subsystem of qubits. The "
"Hamiltonian should be provided in dense matrix format."
msgstr ""
"**局部演化** "
"(:py:func:`tensorcircuit.timeevol.ode_evol_local`)：适用于作用于量子比特子系统的含时哈密顿量。哈密顿量应以稠密矩阵格式提供。"

#: ../../source/advance.rst:466
msgid ""
"Both ODE-based methods support automatic differentiation and JIT "
"compilation when using the JAX backend, making them suitable for "
"optimization tasks in quantum control and variational quantum algorithms."
" The methods integrate the time-dependent Schrödinger equation using "
"JAX's ODE solvers, providing flexible and efficient simulation of quantum"
" dynamics with time-dependent Hamiltonians."
msgstr ""
"两种基于 ODE 的方法在绘制 JAX 后端时都支持自动微分和 JIT 编译，使其适用于量子控制和变分量子算法中的优化任务。这些方法使用 JAX "
"的 ODE 求解器积分随时间变化的薛定谔方程，为具有随时间变化的哈密顿量的量子动力学提供灵活且高效的模拟。"

#: ../../source/advance.rst:471
msgid ""
"ODE-based methods currently only support the JAX backend due to the "
"dependency on JAX's ODE solvers."
msgstr "由于依赖 JAX 的 ODE 求解器，基于 ODE 的方法目前仅支持 JAX 后端。"

#: ../../source/advance.rst:472
msgid ""
"Global evolution requires sparse Hamiltonian matrices for efficiency with"
" large systems."
msgstr "全局演化在大系统中需要稀疏哈密顿矩阵以保证效率。"

#: ../../source/advance.rst:473
msgid ""
"Local evolution requires dense Hamiltonian matrices and is suitable for "
"subsystems with few qubits."
msgstr "局部演化需要稠密哈密顿矩阵，适用于量子比特数较少的子系统。"

#: ../../source/advance.rst:474
msgid ""
"Both methods support callback functions to compute observables during "
"evolution without storing all state vectors."
msgstr "两种方法都支持回调函数，以便在演化过程中计算可观测核，而无需存储所有状态向量。"

#: ../../source/advance.rst:476
msgid "**Lindblad master equation**"
msgstr "**Lindblad 主方程**"

#: ../../source/advance.rst:478
msgid ""
"``tc.timeevol.mesolve`` evolves a dense density matrix under a "
"Hamiltonian and collapse operators on the JAX backend with ``diffrax`` "
"installed. It uses the same time grid, callback convention, and diffrax "
"solver options as ``ode_evol_global``. The example below computes the "
"excited-state population of a decaying qubit for several decay rates."
msgstr ""
"``tc.timeevol.mesolve`` 在安装了 ``diffrax`` 的 JAX "
"后端上，根据哈密顿量和坍缩算符演化稠密密度矩阵。它使用与 ``ode_evol_global`` 相同的时间网格、回调约定和 diffrax "
"求解器选项。下面的示例计算衰减量子比特在不同衰减率下的激发态布居。"

#: ../../source/advance.rst:502
msgid ""
"Hamiltonians and collapse operators can also be functions of the form "
"``op(t, *args)``, with ``args`` passed after ``callback``. For a narrow "
"smooth pulse, use an upper bound such as ``dtmax=pulse_width / 10`` to "
"resolve its shape. For a square pulse, pass its known switching times as "
"``jump_ts=[t_on, t_off]`` so that an integration step does not cross "
"either discontinuity."
msgstr ""
"哈密顿量和坍缩算符也可以是形如 ``op(t, *args)`` 的函数，其中 ``args`` 在 ``callback`` "
