msgstr ""
"有关详细的端到端示例、分布式调度细节和多 GPU VQE 优化，请参阅 `分布式模拟教程 <https://tensorcircuit-"
"ng.readthedocs.io/en/latest/tutorials/distributed_simulation.html>`__。"

